  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>The International Business School (IBS) Hungary is one of the top private universities in the country, founded back in 1991. Whether you’re interested in business administration, management, international business, or finance, IBS offers a wide range of undergraduate and postgraduate programmes designed to get you career-ready.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>IBS brings together students from over 100 countries, giving you a multicultural environment. The university also hosts career fairs and events, so that you get to meet industry professionals.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>IBS Hungary provides on-campus accommodation in its Residence Hall, which features suite-style rooms with high-speed internet. You can choose to stay in one of the university halls, in the city centre, or in private accommodation such as the Móricz Student Building, CEU Residence Hall, or the Fuse accommodation in Budapest.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Library</strong><br>Whether you prefer reading books, journals, or using e-resources, the library has everything you need for your academics, along with quiet study areas.</p><p><strong>Cafeteria</strong><br>You’ll find delicious food at the Planteen Cafe, with a daily changing lunch menu. You can also explore other cafes and places to eat near the campus.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
